Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1025-1026] Onigashima 35 - Twin Dragons.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Edited by fedew
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Subtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.08,0:01:25.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.16,0:01:27.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck're ya doin', Momo!\NGet flyin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.46,0:01:32.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No... I... I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.34,0:01:34.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.55,0:01:40.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,M-My body will not move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.85,0:01:45.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-Do you realize how high up I would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.73,0:01:48.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,were I to so much as raise my head?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.69,0:01:50.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who cares, dummy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.44,0:01:53.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a grown man and\Nstill scared o' heights?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.69,0:01:56.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Silence!\NI will not tolerate insolence!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.53,0:01:58.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-There is naught we samurai fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.86,0:02:02.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then get flyin'!\NFly, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.58,0:02:05.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I cannot, not right this moment!\NLater, perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.25,0:02:08.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The hell'd ya grow up for, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.08,0:02:09.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a dragon!\NFly!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.96,0:02:12.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know that!\NDo not hurry me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:14.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're in a hurry, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.13,0:02:17.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we let Kaido run wild around Onigashima,\Neveryone's gonna be toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.13,0:02:19.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I understand that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.97,0:02:22.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alas, my heart is not prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.26,0:02:24.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quit givin' me excuses...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.14,0:02:26.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.81,0:02:28.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Owowowowowow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.18,0:02:30.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, would you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.85,0:02:32.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaddap!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.48,0:02:35.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You and me're puttin'\NKaido down, together!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.75,0:02:55.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mirror Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.72,0:03:05.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Defended yourself, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.89,0:03:08.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I cannot fall, not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.23,0:03:13.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not until Luffy returns!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.86,0:03:20.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All I need do is to\Nsurvive until that moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:32.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hallowed Glacier Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.06,0:03:55.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.94,0:04:02.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Challenging me,\Nlike you were one of Wano's own people...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.53,0:04:09.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.29,0:04:11.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're an ogre's child!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:19.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you are still the son of Kaido!\NYou can't run...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.17,0:04:22.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from what's in your blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.97,0:04:26.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.97,0:04:30.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter what or who\Nyou choose to fight for,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:35.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,not a single samurai here...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.31,0:04:41.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sees you as one of their own!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.07,0:04:47.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.49,0:04:49.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That has nothing to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.24,0:04:53.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...with how I feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.77,0:05:19.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've been living\Non this island all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.77,0:05:23.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Running around the island,\Ncrawling inside ceilings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.57,0:05:26.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've been alone your whole life!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.37,0:05:34.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I do...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:37.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...have friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.04,0:05:39.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have a precious friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.34,0:05:41.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.67,0:05:43.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I had!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.35,0:06:00.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you did.\NLike those samurai back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:08.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyone that was ever\Nnice to you is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.31,0:06:37.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No wonder 'tis so cold.\NIt is snowing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.81,0:06:43.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am so hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.86,0:06:47.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How hungry I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.43,0:07:17.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There you are, Ogre Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.64,0:07:24.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please wait, Ogre Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.11,0:07:26.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.36,0:07:29.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here, take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.75,0:07:43.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Before someone sees, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.12,0:07:44.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:48.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:52.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:01.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yum...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:03.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So delicious...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.56,0:08:07.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you... Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:11.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good for you, Ogre Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.41,0:08:23.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, so why'd he get the axe\Nall of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.12,0:08:28.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heard he was slipping food\Nto the Ogre Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.67,0:08:33.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even got her a blanket,\Nthinking she was freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.47,0:08:36.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Awww, awful nice of 'im!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.47,0:08:40.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Ogre Princess is still on the run, isn't she?\NSaying she wants to become Oden...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.73,0:08:46.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They did not simply die.\NYou murdered them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.60,0:08:49.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They got in the way of me\Neducating my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:51.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They deserved it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.65,0:08:54.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should know better by now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.91,0:08:58.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.43,0:09:25.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have no friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.35,0:09:32.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if you think those\NWano people're on your side,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:35.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that's just on the surface!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.45,0:09:38.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're all afraid of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.78,0:09:43.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta rule people by force!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.70,0:09:46.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that's because\Nyou're the kid of an ogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.42,0:09:52.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't be friends with humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.84,0:09:55.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that's just life for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.67,0:09:58.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:07.60,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1486,326)}Tokage Port\NUdon
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.31,0:10:09.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Attaboy, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.53,0:10:17.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:20.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice!\NKeep it up, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.58,0:10:25.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fly us to Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.95,0:10:27.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sally forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.83,0:10:29.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.67,0:10:30.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.79,0:10:32.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:35.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onward! Onward!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:38.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, talk about fast!\NGotta be a dragon thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.97,0:10:41.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep going and we'll\Ncatch up in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:10:55.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're off-course!\NLeft!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.11,0:10:56.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo! More to the left!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.82,0:10:58.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Left?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.36,0:10:59.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.65,0:11:01.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.49,0:11:04.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's it! Attaboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:09.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right! Onigashima...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.29,0:11:11.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've caught up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:18.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see a shadow on the rooftop!\NThink that's Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:19.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To the rooftop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.01,0:11:21.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rooftop?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.47,0:11:23.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.47,0:11:27.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, no! Not up!\NDown!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.06,0:11:27.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Down?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.68,0:11:28.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Down?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:41.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! No! No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.82,0:11:44.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not that way!\NAre your eyes even open?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.99,0:11:48.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You buffoon!\NHow could I possibly fly with eyes open?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.33,0:11:49.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.25,0:11:51.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.71,0:11:56.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This ain't the rooftop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.21,0:12:02.22,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(246,366)}Skull Dome\NPerformance Floor
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.88,0:12:04.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three-Sword Style...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:16.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.61,0:12:18.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A dragon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.48,0:12:21.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Kaido-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.07,0:12:22.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, that's not right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.70,0:12:27.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh! Another dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.99,0:12:31.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh? Luffy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:35.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hit the brakes!\NStop, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.25,0:12:35.25,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(962,94)}Luffy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.25,0:12:36.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, 'boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:38.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.75,0:12:40.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A sight for sore eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.67,0:12:43.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoahuhwhaaaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.47,0:12:48.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop, Momo!\NWhat the hell're ya doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:55.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A dragon?!\NKaido, that you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.69,0:12:58.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hatter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.15,0:13:00.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.27,0:13:02.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's. Going. On?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.78,0:13:05.78,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(267,355)}Castle Interior\N3rd Floor
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.24,0:13:11.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cut it out, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.37,0:13:13.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.54,0:13:14.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Tis impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.62,0:13:14.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Tis impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:17.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, something got into them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.71,0:13:26.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's all 'cause you crashed\Ninto a buncha stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:28.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do something, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.84,0:13:31.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.51,0:13:34.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show me what yer made of\Nand look in front!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.81,0:13:38.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a wall!\NBraaaakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.27,0:13:40.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.65,0:13:41.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.98,0:13:48.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Castle Interior, Third Floor reporting in!\NRight now, Kaido-san's on the rampage...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.24,0:13:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! That's not him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.20,0:13:56.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The color's different, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:56.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!\NBut there can't be two dragons!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:14:00.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Find out who the pink dragon is!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.26,0:14:11.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pretty damn noisy down there...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.76,0:14:14.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Linlin, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:17.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gonna have to rebuild the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.31,0:14:22.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...I cannot let things...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.52,0:14:23.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...end like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:41.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Divine... Swiftness!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.84,0:14:43.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.46,0:14:45.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.75,0:14:47.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On the rooftop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:48.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are we there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.67,0:14:50.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.89,0:14:55.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are mid air!\NI must return to solid ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.51,0:14:57.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.39,0:14:59.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right down there,\Nmake a dive for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.44,0:15:00.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.53,0:15:07.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gear 4:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.03,0:15:16.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Snakeman!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.12,0:15:20.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.83,0:15:23.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.59,0:15:25.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Divine Swiftness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.67,0:15:30.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,White Serpent!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.27,0:15:41.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jet Culverin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:41.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.12,0:16:45.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.33,0:16:47.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Yamabro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.42,0:16:51.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you're the one that's been\Nholding off Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.13,0:16:53.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saved our butts!\NThanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.72,0:16:56.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A sight for sore eyes!\NI have been waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.18,0:16:58.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A pink dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.93,0:16:59.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It cannot be...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.16,0:17:21.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How in the hell did you live...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.95,0:17:23.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.83,0:17:25.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How in the hell would I die?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.04,0:17:31.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm the future Pirate King!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.50,0:17:35.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And who the hell's that dragon\Nsupposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.51,0:17:37.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,M-My...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:43.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.89,0:17:47.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Kozuki Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.23,0:17:50.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The future Shogun of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.08,0:18:06.58,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1694,412)}Flower Capital\NLand of Wano
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.08,0:18:11.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enjoying yourself, O-Toko?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.96,0:18:12.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.93,0:18:20.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, O-Tama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.93,0:18:28.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you realize the danger\Nin what you are doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.69,0:18:31.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.77,0:18:34.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't help it,\NI gotta do somethin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.61,0:18:36.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.49,0:18:40.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll protect her with our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.37,0:18:45.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.04,0:18:53.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Tama, are you faring well?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.09,0:19:02.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alas, she is a sea away...\NAnd I have no way of knowing...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.45,0:19:26.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Reporting in,\Nconcerning a mysterious dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.79,0:19:31.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On the rooftop, Young Master Yamato\Nstands alone, bruised and bloodied.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.63,0:19:36.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So Yamato was the one\Nholding off Kaido-san...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.55,0:19:43.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And in the skies,\Nsomething unbelievable is taking place...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.31,0:19:48.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two dragons, squaring off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.23,0:19:55.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Facing Kaido-sama,\Nthe Azure Dragon...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.02,0:19:57.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...is a pink dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.44,0:20:02.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And a pirate upon its back...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:04.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.24,0:20:11.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The pink dragon's identity\Nis unknown!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.71,0:20:18.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But there is no doubt\Nit is an enemy of ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.18,0:20:29.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.35,0:20:31.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your form resembles...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.23,0:20:35.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.10,0:20:40.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I could become a monster such as he,\NI would be of some help to everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.07,0:20:42.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.99,0:20:48.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a surprise!\NYou're that brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.37,0:20:52.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:57.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the world ain't big enough\Nfor two dragons!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.14,0:21:08.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's breathing fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.60,0:21:10.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right,\Nyou breathe something too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.72,0:21:13.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Breathe what?!\NI cannot possibly...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.06,0:21:14.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo, you can breathe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.23,0:21:22.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Humans cannot\Nsimply breathe fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.57,0:21:25.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blast Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.01,0:21:49.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-No! I am not here to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.93,0:21:51.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.31,0:21:54.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaaaat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.52,0:21:59.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gear 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.69,0:22:06.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, Luffy! I cannot, I cannot!\N'Tis impossible for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.17,0:22:20.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.25,0:22:26.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elephant Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.72,0:22:33.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.60,0:22:36.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take a bite outta Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.06,0:22:38.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I cannot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.49,0:22:48.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.28,0:22:54.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All will be well!\NI will ensure the two of you escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.95,0:22:56.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is a way out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.98,0:23:21.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.47,0:23:58.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your father was a fool of a lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.06,0:24:00.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is your name?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.60,0:24:01.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.44,0:24:07.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mo...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.45,0:24:15.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.66,0:24:17.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.29,0:24:18.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.75,0:24:31.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you doing, brats?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.85,0:24:44.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You laid waste to my country!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.60,0:24:48.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Were it not for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.98,0:24:50.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Father would...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.49,0:24:52.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mother would.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.07,0:25:01.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thought I asked you\Nwhat the hell you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.83,0:25:10.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get away, Momonosuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.00,0:25:12.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blast Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.23,0:25:25.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's it, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.52,0:25:28.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Momonosuke-sama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.11,0:25:32.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama is a dragon!\NA pink one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.82,0:25:34.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Attaboy, Momonosuke-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.05,0:25:57.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's Kaido you just bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.94,0:26:11.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dragons bring\Nwith them thunderclouds...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.65,0:26:16.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And there are two dragons here...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.11,0:26:19.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means no more moon tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.20,0:26:29.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One more hit from you and\NI probably wouldn't be getting up ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.37,0:26:35.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Sulong transformation is a double-edged sword,\Nfeeding on your life force.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.09,0:26:38.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the end for you, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.07,0:27:04.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He lost his Sulong form!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.62,0:27:06.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Master Nekomamushi!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.87,0:27:10.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, now!\NNo butting in!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.21,0:27:18.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't blame the moon...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.22,0:27:22.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not like your luck's run out!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.05,0:27:23.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mlem!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.85,0:27:26.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just that I'm too lucky,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.68,0:27:28.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.86,0:27:35.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.91,0:27:43.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.91,0:27:47.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.70,0:27:50.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...an Emperor of the Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.04,0:27:56.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There anything left in the world\Nfor ya to be scared of?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.59,0:27:58.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.47,0:28:08.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nay!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.94,0:28:22.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.45,0:28:25.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.07,0:28:27.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.29,0:28:31.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.67,0:28:35.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.76,0:28:43.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As for Kaido,\NI'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.09,0:28:48.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...one hundred percent...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.05,0:28:50.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.83,0:29:13.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy's...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.29,0:29:14.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy's...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.87,0:29:19.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...back in tip-top shape!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.42,0:29:26.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go get 'em, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.38,0:29:29.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.81,0:29:33.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.23,0:29:36.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a comedian!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.81,0:29:41.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not surprised to\Nhear that outta him!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.65,0:29:43.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where the hell's he been?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.07,0:29:47.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.57,0:29:48.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.74,0:29:50.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.74,0:29:54.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When Luffy says he's gonna do something,\Nhe does it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.66,0:29:56.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.21,0:29:56.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo-kuuun!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.92,0:29:58.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo-kuuun!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.54,0:29:59.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.71,0:30:02.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get 'em, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.51,0:30:09.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finally time, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.64,0:30:11.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is just the beginning...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.29,0:30:45.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you think you have even the\Nslightest chance of beating me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.64,0:30:53.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Long as I'm breathin'...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.39,0:30:57.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got all the\Nchances in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.09,0:31:29.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I once read in his journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.55,0:31:34.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When Roger and Whitebeard clashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.10,0:31:44.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the heavens were rent asunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.15,0:31:53.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Reporting... in...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.12,0:31:58.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The heavens... are split...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.38,0:32:11.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.97,0:32:22.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's luckier meow?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.53,0:32:42.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Getting real exciting,\Nisn't it, Kaido...?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.92,0:32:45.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.59,0:32:53.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got our own\Ngame to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.93,0:33:03.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.27,0:33:04.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...One-Sword Style:
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.53,0:33:22.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Feline...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.63,0:33:35.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Frenzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.89,0:33:45.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Worthless pile of dog crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.19,0:33:51.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Cleaver!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.52,0:34:31.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pedro...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.65,0:34:36.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wish I could knock a few back\Nwith you gara while moon gazin'...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.65,0:34:40.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Master Nekomamushi!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.45,0:34:42.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.45,0:34:45.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was amazing, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.91,0:34:47.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.04,0:34:49.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've finally done it, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.08,0:34:53.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pedro... would be happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.92,0:34:57.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All you-gara...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.55,0:35:02.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Careful now,\Nor you'll turn Sulong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.10,0:35:05.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haven't a damn clue why,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.60,0:35:08.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but the moon's\Ntotally out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.87,0:35:28.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Such is our rage,\Nall we of the Mink Tribe!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.01,0:35:40.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can hardly believe it!\NThe Jack is...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.76,0:35:46.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I did not expect one of\Nthe All-Stars to be taken down!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.93,0:35:50.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.48,0:35:53.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That does not matter to me!
